    "detailed_description": "Online PvP where you create a team of adorable characters to battle against... other adorable characters!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- No turn timer (async multiplayer) Start and stop the game at your convenience, returning when ready to continue the adventure.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Make the characters more powerful and adorable by combining to evolve<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Select spells and collect relics to build synergy<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- The cost of characters changes as players around the world shift the meta.  Everyone buying bunnies?? Bunnies will automatically cost more! Enjoy an auto-balancing, meta destroying, anti-netdecking sytem that keeps the game fresh<br />\r\n<br />\r\n(coming soon) Construct your initial deck from an army of characters, balancing their synergy.<br />\r\n(coming soon) Coop to build teams with friends and live matches to face the same opponent until the bitter, but adorable, end!",
